WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.029
I'm just two blocks
from the Apollo Theater,

00:00:02.029 --> 00:00:03.686
and behind me is one of
the great institutions

00:00:03.686 --> 00:00:06.511
here in Harlem, Sylvia's Restaurant.

00:00:06.511 --> 00:00:07.344
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.344 --> 00:00:08.705
They've been making and
serving soul food here

00:00:08.705 --> 00:00:10.295
since 1962.

00:00:10.295 --> 00:00:13.477
Sylvia Woods' family still runs the place.

00:00:13.477 --> 00:00:17.310
They've agreed to let
me serve soul food today

00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:19.316
in the restaurant.

00:00:19.316 --> 00:00:20.535
What could go wrong?

00:00:20.535 --> 00:00:22.439
What could go wrong?

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:24.993
This is one of Sylvia's granddaughters.

00:00:24.993 --> 00:00:25.826
Is that right?

00:00:25.826 --> 00:00:26.659
Yes.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:27.609
And your name is--

00:00:27.609 --> 00:00:28.442
Zaqura.

00:00:28.442 --> 00:00:29.275
Zaqura?

00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:30.108
Yes.

00:00:30.108 --> 00:00:30.941
But people call you--

00:00:30.941 --> 00:00:31.774
Z.

00:00:31.774 --> 00:00:32.607
OK.

00:00:32.607 --> 00:00:33.440
This is going to shock you.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:34.273
Mm-hmm.

00:00:34.273 --> 00:00:35.106
I don't know much about soul food.

00:00:35.106 --> 00:00:37.140
Main ingredient, when you're
dealing with soul food,

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.045
is love.

00:00:38.045 --> 00:00:38.878
So, you have--

00:00:38.878 --> 00:00:39.711
Oh, love!

00:00:39.711 --> 00:00:40.544
Yeah.

00:00:40.544 --> 00:00:41.435
We had none of that growing up.

00:00:41.435 --> 00:00:42.268
(audience laughing)

00:00:42.268 --> 00:00:43.101
Yes.

00:00:43.101 --> 00:00:44.164
There was no love in the house,

00:00:44.164 --> 00:00:47.635
let alone enough leftover
to put it in the food.

00:00:47.635 --> 00:00:48.907
Everyone has eaten at Sylvia's.

00:00:48.907 --> 00:00:50.101
Not everybody has.

00:00:50.101 --> 00:00:50.934
[Conan] Not everybody.

00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:51.767
But most people.

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:52.829
There is Liza Minnelli.

00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:53.662
Mm-hmm.

00:00:53.662 --> 00:00:54.571
OK.

00:00:54.571 --> 00:00:55.813
[Conan] Is that Denzel right there?

00:00:55.813 --> 00:00:56.646
[Zaqura] That is.

00:00:56.646 --> 00:00:57.479
OK.

00:00:57.479 --> 00:00:58.312
There's Ice-T.

00:00:58.312 --> 00:00:59.145
[Zaqura] Yup, mm-hmm.

00:00:59.145 --> 00:00:59.978
Look at him.

00:00:59.978 --> 00:01:00.811
He looks so mad all the time.

00:01:00.811 --> 00:01:01.644
(audience laughing)

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:02.477
That's probably him

00:01:02.477 --> 00:01:03.963
after you've just told
him a really funny joke.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:04.796
(audience laughing)

00:01:04.796 --> 00:01:05.867
And there's Bill Clinton.

00:01:05.867 --> 00:01:06.700
[Zaqura] Mm-hmm.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.533
Everyone's having fun in this picture--

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:08.366
(audience cheering)

00:01:08.366 --> 00:01:09.884
Except the Secret Service guy.

00:01:09.884 --> 00:01:11.626
There's no joy in his life.

00:01:11.626 --> 00:01:12.459
(audience laughing)

00:01:12.459 --> 00:01:13.832
Liza Minnelli, again.

00:01:13.832 --> 00:01:14.865
[Zaqura] Yes.

00:01:14.865 --> 00:01:15.979
[Conan] She keeps these in her Purse.

00:01:15.979 --> 00:01:16.885
[Zaqura] Yeah.

00:01:16.885 --> 00:01:17.718
She comes in.

00:01:17.718 --> 00:01:19.021
She orders a bunch of soup.

00:01:19.021 --> 00:01:19.854
You're off getting it.

00:01:19.854 --> 00:01:20.687
(mimicking hammer pounding)

00:01:20.687 --> 00:01:22.075
(laughing)

00:01:22.075 --> 00:01:22.908
Come here.

00:01:22.908 --> 00:01:23.741
Look at this.

00:01:23.741 --> 00:01:24.574
(laughing)

00:01:24.574 --> 00:01:25.407
Look at this.

00:01:25.407 --> 00:01:26.649
Liza Minnelli, again!

00:01:26.649 --> 00:01:27.601
(audience laughing)

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:29.888
That's three times for Liza Minnelli.

00:01:29.888 --> 00:01:30.829
That is.

00:01:30.829 --> 00:01:32.071
This is bullshit.

00:01:32.071 --> 00:01:32.904
(audience laughing)

00:01:32.904 --> 00:01:34.428
How do I get my photo up here?

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:35.461
Would that be hard to do?

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:36.587
No, not at all.

00:01:36.587 --> 00:01:37.420
But here's the problem,

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:38.886
this is the face I make in my photo.

00:01:38.886 --> 00:01:39.719
Check it out.

00:01:39.719 --> 00:01:40.552
(camera shutter whirring)

00:01:40.552 --> 00:01:41.701
[Zaqura] That's gotta stay.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:43.755
Z, I'm ready to get started.

00:01:43.755 --> 00:01:44.835
How do I begin?

00:01:44.835 --> 00:01:45.668
Bam.

00:01:45.668 --> 00:01:46.501
[Zaqura] Boom.

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:47.467
OK.

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:50.467
(audience laughing)

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:52.193
Be honest with me.

00:01:52.193 --> 00:01:53.201
How does the hairnet look?

00:01:53.201 --> 00:01:54.034
[Conan] It's not cute?

00:01:54.034 --> 00:01:54.867
But--

00:01:56.225 --> 00:01:58.108
(audience laughing and applauding)

00:01:58.108 --> 00:01:59.132
I'm not a white girl.

00:01:59.132 --> 00:02:00.409
(laughing)

00:02:00.409 --> 00:02:01.268
I'm a dude.

00:02:01.268 --> 00:02:02.601
Not like that.

00:02:03.595 --> 00:02:04.428
[Conan] I'm getting nervous to--

00:02:04.428 --> 00:02:05.261
We love you though.

00:02:05.261 --> 00:02:06.094
We love you.

00:02:06.094 --> 00:02:06.927
I love you, too.

00:02:06.927 --> 00:02:07.760
I'm a very pretty white girl.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:08.593
(audience laughing)

00:02:08.593 --> 00:02:09.771
Does Z ever go over the counter?

00:02:09.771 --> 00:02:10.604
(laughing)

00:02:10.604 --> 00:02:11.907
Wouldn't that be faster

00:02:11.907 --> 00:02:13.811
than actually the way you're doing it?

00:02:13.811 --> 00:02:14.644
There we go.

00:02:14.644 --> 00:02:16.319
Here you go.

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:17.190
Perspiring a little bit.

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:18.432
(audience laughing)

00:02:18.432 --> 00:02:21.659
Just wipe down the
pornographer's sideburns.

00:02:21.659 --> 00:02:22.774
(audience laughing)

00:02:22.774 --> 00:02:23.607
And the jewelry.

00:02:23.607 --> 00:02:25.140
(audience laughing)

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:26.851
Do you mind if I just
get in here for a second?

00:02:26.851 --> 00:02:27.684
Nah, man.

00:02:27.684 --> 00:02:28.517
Go for it.

00:02:30.079 --> 00:02:32.018
This is the best chicken I've ever had,

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:33.516
and you know what I love about it?

00:02:33.516 --> 00:02:34.349
It's free.

00:02:34.349 --> 00:02:35.182
He's paying for it.

00:02:35.182 --> 00:02:37.939
(laughing)

00:02:37.939 --> 00:02:38.937
(telephone ringing)

00:02:38.937 --> 00:02:39.770
All right.

00:02:41.248 --> 00:02:44.545
Hello, Sylvia's, in operation since 1962,

00:02:44.545 --> 00:02:47.761
Harlem's premier soul food restaurant,

00:02:47.761 --> 00:02:51.557
best soul food in Harlem,
best place to get it,

00:02:51.557 --> 00:02:53.369
only two blocks from the Apollo Theater,

00:02:53.369 --> 00:02:55.087
Malcolm X Boulevard.

00:02:55.087 --> 00:02:56.527
You gotta come to Sylvia's.

00:02:56.527 --> 00:02:57.360
They hung up.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.310
(audience laughing)

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:01.042
[Woman] And then you click sign in.

00:03:01.042 --> 00:03:01.875
What number was that?

00:03:01.875 --> 00:03:02.900
I don't know how to do that.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.805
This is like a nuclear launch code.

00:03:04.805 --> 00:03:06.593
Why does this have to
go through the Pentagon?

00:03:06.593 --> 00:03:08.311
I will try to use this system,

00:03:08.311 --> 00:03:10.645
but I just took money out of your ATM.

00:03:10.645 --> 00:03:13.312
(angelic music)

00:03:18.993 --> 00:03:22.702
(audience laughing)

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:23.773
(classical music)

00:03:23.773 --> 00:03:26.773
(audience laughing)

00:03:29.931 --> 00:03:30.764
What would you like?

00:03:30.764 --> 00:03:32.248
Would you like some waffles?

00:03:32.248 --> 00:03:33.560
Would you like some biscuits?

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.745
Would you like chicken?

00:03:34.745 --> 00:03:36.440
Do you want dark meat, white meat?

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:37.554
You want it smothered or fried?

00:03:37.554 --> 00:03:39.528
(laughing)

00:03:39.528 --> 00:03:43.611
Listen, I get off of work
probably in 10 minutes.

00:03:44.532 --> 00:03:45.600
I think I'm getting fired.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:46.529
(audience laughing)

00:03:46.529 --> 00:03:47.562
If you want to show me
around the neighborhood.

00:03:47.562 --> 00:03:48.395
(laughing)

00:03:48.395 --> 00:03:49.745
Hello, Sylvia's.

00:03:49.745 --> 00:03:51.266
Yup, 1962.

00:03:51.266 --> 00:03:52.949
Best soul food in Harlem.

00:03:52.949 --> 00:03:53.782
Yup.

00:03:53.782 --> 00:03:55.782
Come and see three, count 'em three,

00:03:55.782 --> 00:03:57.523
photographs of Liza
Minnelli for no reason.

00:03:57.523 --> 00:03:58.591
(audience laughing)

00:03:58.591 --> 00:03:59.660
I'm Conan, so good to see you.

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:00.493
Jessie.

00:04:00.493 --> 00:04:01.326
Jessie, good to see you.

00:04:01.326 --> 00:04:02.353
You're a Yankee fan?

00:04:02.353 --> 00:04:03.793
Of course I am.

00:04:03.793 --> 00:04:04.626
What are you?

00:04:04.626 --> 00:04:05.459
Red Sox.

00:04:05.459 --> 00:04:06.292
Get out of here.

00:04:06.292 --> 00:04:07.125
Why this guy is here?

00:04:07.125 --> 00:04:07.958
Red Sox?

00:04:07.958 --> 00:04:08.791
Well, what the hell?

00:04:08.791 --> 00:04:09.624
What are you talkin' about?

00:04:09.624 --> 00:04:10.457
Listen, you're in my restaurant, OK?

00:04:10.457 --> 00:04:13.220
I've been working in
Sylvia's for 45 minutes.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:16.227
You can't come in here and
tell me that my team sucks.

00:04:16.227 --> 00:04:17.481
I've got one question for you.

00:04:17.481 --> 00:04:18.314
Go ahead.

00:04:18.314 --> 00:04:21.196
It's always Yankee, Giants.

00:04:21.196 --> 00:04:23.100
You are Yankee, Jets.

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:23.933
You know what I think?

00:04:23.933 --> 00:04:26.606
Giants suck this year, and
you switched to that team.

00:04:26.606 --> 00:04:27.439
(audience laughing)

00:04:27.439 --> 00:04:28.272
You're a lucky guesser.

00:04:28.272 --> 00:04:29.105
(laughing)

00:04:29.105 --> 00:04:29.938
Is that what you did!?

00:04:29.938 --> 00:04:30.821
I knew that's what he did!

00:04:30.821 --> 00:04:31.654
You're good, you're good.

00:04:31.654 --> 00:04:32.499
You have a Giants jersey at home.

00:04:32.499 --> 00:04:33.332
Yes.

00:04:33.332 --> 00:04:34.165
You buried it--

00:04:34.165 --> 00:04:34.998
Or another one.

00:04:34.998 --> 00:04:36.179
In your backyard, and you're
wearing a Jets jersey.

00:04:36.179 --> 00:04:37.399
Sir, I'm giving away cakes today.

00:04:37.399 --> 00:04:38.232
That's for you.

00:04:38.232 --> 00:04:39.065
You take that one home with you.

00:04:39.065 --> 00:04:39.898
(audience laughing)

00:04:39.898 --> 00:04:40.731
What are you trying to kill me?

00:04:40.731 --> 00:04:41.564
Come on.

00:04:41.564 --> 00:04:42.397
I'm diabetic, man.

00:04:42.397 --> 00:04:43.230
You're trying to kill me!

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:44.063
Just take it.

00:04:44.063 --> 00:04:44.896
Give it to someone on the street.

00:04:44.896 --> 00:04:45.729
(telephone ringing)

00:04:45.729 --> 00:04:46.562
All right.

00:04:46.562 --> 00:04:47.395
Hello, Sylvia's.

00:04:47.395 --> 00:04:48.228
Yes, free cakes today.

00:04:48.228 --> 00:04:49.061
Free cakes today--

00:04:49.061 --> 00:04:49.894
That's a--

00:04:49.894 --> 00:04:50.727
For everyone that comes in.

00:04:50.727 --> 00:04:51.560
(audience laughing)

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:52.393
♫ Birthday

00:04:52.393 --> 00:04:53.226
♫ Happy birthday

00:04:53.226 --> 00:04:55.596
♫ Happy birthday to you

00:04:55.596 --> 00:04:56.429
Yeah!

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:57.709
(group applauding)

00:04:57.709 --> 00:05:01.042
♫ Happy birthday to you

00:05:02.678 --> 00:05:05.428
♫ Happy birthday

00:05:06.394 --> 00:05:09.144
♫ Happy birthday

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:14.240
♫ Happy birthday

00:05:15.539 --> 00:05:17.639
(audience laughing)

00:05:17.639 --> 00:05:19.722
♫ To you

00:05:24.089 --> 00:05:24.922
I don't know.

00:05:24.922 --> 00:05:28.060
I thought that I did a
pretty good job today

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:32.227
and showed that I got
better as time went on.

00:05:32.412 --> 00:05:35.663
I made some mistakes early on.

00:05:35.663 --> 00:05:37.520
Is there someplace here I could work?

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.577
(water rushing)

00:05:38.577 --> 00:05:40.691
(audience laughing)

00:05:40.691 --> 00:05:42.642
Well, I'm not working the counter,

00:05:42.642 --> 00:05:44.929
but I'm still working at Sylvia's,

00:05:44.929 --> 00:05:46.670
and that's pretty cool.

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:49.503
Sylvia's, clean dishes since 1962.

00:05:50.757 --> 00:05:51.697
(audience laughing)

00:05:51.697 --> 00:05:52.530
[Man] We need clean plates!

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:53.636
I'm hurrying!

00:05:53.636 --> 00:05:56.272
(classical music)

00:05:56.272 --> 00:06:00.439
(audience laughing and applauding)

